I am an attorney with National Funding. We sent you a legal demand and have not heard back from you. In light of the COVID-19 pandemic, we have additional payment options that we can offer to get you back on track and avoid litigation. Please email or call me as soon as possible to discuss as if we do not hear from you we will move forward with preparing the lawsuit.


Thank you,

